OL,3,GNEWSAPair set for hospital sleepout for
OL,4,AChristmas appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo women who help organise an annual
OL,7,Fgiving tree which spreads Christmas joy
OL,8,Fare staging a sleepout in the hope of
OL,9,Fhelping even more vulnerable children
OL,10,Fand young people.
OL,12,FEach year, Christmas trees at the
OL,13,Fentrances of Peterborough City,
OL,14,FHinchingbrooke, and Stamford & Rutland
OL,15,Fhospitals are festooned with tags, each
OL,16,Fwith a child's name, age and gift
OL,17,Frequest, which visitors can buy and
OL,18,Fdonate.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
