OL,3,GNEWSAPair set for hospital sleepout for
OL,4,AChristmas appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FNatalie Styles-Hudson, site senior
OL,7,Fmanager at North West Anglia NHS
OL,8,FFoundation Trust, believes the
OL,9,Finitiative has delivered more than
OL,10,F10,000 presents since its inception in
OL,11,F2015.
OL,13,FShe and deputy service manager Sharron
OL,14,FCarey hope to raise funds, awareness
OL,15,Fand "add a little extra excitement" by
OL,16,Fcamping outside Peterborough City
OL,17,FHospital overnight on 12 November.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
